        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>WonderLang Japanese</strong>, where mastering Japanese becomes an <strong>engaging RPG journey</strong>. Immerse yourself in captivating quests, interactive dialogues, and fun puzzles <strong>designed to make language learning seamless and enjoyable</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This page is for the <strong>Japanese-learning version</strong> of WonderLang, focusing on <strong>standard Japanese</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn Japanese from the following base (starting) languages: English, French, Spanish, German, Italian, Portuguese, Korean, Chinese, Japanese, Dutch, Indonesian, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian, and Arabic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other WonderLang versions are also available so you can learn <strong>French, Spanish, German, Portuguese, Italian, Korean,  Japanese, and Chinese. English is coming in February 2026</strong>. There is also a <strong>WonderLang Polyglot</strong> edition that gives you access to <strong>all languages, including future releases</strong> in a single purchase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo directly in your browser (no install) on our website: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang weaves language into the core of its adventure and narrative. Get immersed in WonderLang as you <strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Fight</strong>, <strong>Converse</strong>, and <strong>Investigate</strong> using your <strong>target language</strong>. Every quest and interaction becomes meaningful practice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More affordable</strong>, <strong>more engaging</strong>, and <strong>way more fun</strong> than any subscription-based <strong>language learning app</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang is designed for <strong>beginner language learners</strong>, allowing you to dive into the game without any prior knowledge of Japanese. While the game does not aim to fully replace traditional language courses, it provides an <strong>immersive and enjoyable way to practice</strong> a new language gradually as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Japanese Learning</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn practical Japanese through every conversation, quest, and puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 45 hours</strong> of combined learning and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Modes</strong> to adapt the difficulty for <strong>very beginners, JLPT N5, and JLPT N4</strong> level learners.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skippable Kana Module and Smart Input Support</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a dedicated <strong>kana module</strong> that teaches you <strong>hiragana and katakana</strong> step by step. You can play it at your own pace or skip it entirely if you already know the kana.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an in-game <strong>graphical Japanese keyboard</strong> to see and select characters visually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between different keyboard modes: type Japanese <strong>phonetically</strong> using your usual layout, or <strong>assign Japanese characters directly</strong> to your keys for precise input.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Reading Modes and Furigana Support</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick between three character learning modes: kana only (no kanji), top 110 kanji (learn the most common 110 kanji while keeping the rest in kana), or full kanji..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable an option to display <strong>furigana</strong> above kanji. Furigana are small kana characters that show how a kanji is pronounced, making it easier to read and learn new words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice <strong>drawing kanji directly on your screen</strong> to internalize stroke order and improve writing memory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the journey of a young hero who must learn Japanese to lift a magical curse from their brother.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant towns, uncover secrets, and build friendships by interacting with over <strong>60 unique NPCs</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning as a Gameplay Mechanic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and complete quests by forming sentences and understanding dialogues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice building sentences and pronunciation with <strong>speech recognition challenges</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game tools such as a <strong>dictionary</strong> and <strong>contextual help</strong> to support your learning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spaced Repetition Combat Challenges</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>language-based combat</strong> to reinforce vocabulary and grammar through repeated exposure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat challenges are designed using the <strong>spaced repetition principle</strong> to boost long term retention and keep your skills sharp.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506220/extras/7918171af313910ab537cf0af37b147d.poster.avif?t=1769871360\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506220/extras/7918171af313910ab537cf0af37b147d.webm?t=1769871360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506220/extras/7918171af313910ab537cf0af37b147d.mp4?t=1769871360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real World Context Practice</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply your Japanese skills in <strong>everyday scenarios</strong> such as buying food, shopping, or making an appointment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience practical vocabulary and grammar in <strong>real world inspired contexts</strong> to enhance your confidence and proficiency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Learning Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your learning journey with difficulty settings that make the experience more relaxed or more challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set <strong>daily goals</strong> and earn rewards for reaching them, helping you build a consistent learning routine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Interactive World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore diverse locations</strong>, each introducing specific Japanese vocabulary and grammar patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in <strong>mini games</strong> like crosswords, memory games, and charades to diversify your learning experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WonderLang can be played with a mouse and keyboard, mouse only, or keyboard only.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It also plays great on the Steam Deck with an official control layout.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo directly in your browser (no install) on our website: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506220/extras/6e46f68cb2492ee721f0862c735137dd.poster.avif?t=1769871360\" width=74 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506220/extras/6e46f68cb2492ee721f0862c735137dd.webm?t=1769871360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506220/extras/75d0459a948d54e66fb02c8ff1cc257c.apng?t=1769871360\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506220/extras/75d0459a948d54e66fb02c8ff1cc257c.poster.avif?t=1769871360\" class=\"bb_img\" width=73 height=107 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                                                 </p>",
